                        "sense_id": "f28cfc95-3d74-3f11-a17b-3c68df207573",
                        "entry_id": "99e95b4f-4c6e-346d-a931-d238201ba02b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A proposed device combining the functions of a computer and a television, telegraph, telephone, teleporter or telecommunicator."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b9acd232-49f4-4edc-96fd-ae183c0322bb",
                                "sense_id": "f28cfc95-3d74-3f11-a17b-3c68df207573",
                                "text": "If Adler has his way, the telecomputer will become an inescapable part of the life of every American. He envisions political campaigns waged with his machines[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5dd47585-fe97-42a6-a838-6ccc34197717",
                                "sense_id": "f28cfc95-3d74-3f11-a17b-3c68df207573",
                                "text": "Like the rulers of radio in 1950, all the entrenched interests are declaring that the new technology of the telecomputer is unlikely to have an impact for a decade or two."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "192cb079-386d-4b3c-b4ac-b9e71ee1534c",
                                "sense_id": "f28cfc95-3d74-3f11-a17b-3c68df207573",
                                "text": "For Gilder, the new piece of furniture that will free Joe Briefcase from passive dependence on his furniture will be “the telecomputer, a personal computer adapted for video processing and connected by fiberoptic threads to other telecomputers around the world.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9cecccb2-4cc2-4350-83f9-9faf8ce089d2",
                                "sense_id": "f28cfc95-3d74-3f11-a17b-3c68df207573",
                                "text": "Great talent is available to conceive and design self-education telecomputer programs: expert programmers, technicians, movie and television directors[…]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "48a09b55-d0da-3887-9151-45e5c7206d57",
                        "entry_id": "99e95b4f-4c6e-346d-a931-d238201ba02b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A computer that can be controlled remotely; a telecomputing system."
